71&#x2013;96. 10.1016/j.ocemod.2007.11.005</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.ocemod.2007.11.005</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zimmermann-Timm H. (2002). Characteristics, dynamics and importance of aggregates in rivers &#x2013; an invited review.
<i>Int. Rev. Hydrobiol.</i>
